  "id": "prolixin",
  "term": "Prolixin",
  "definition": "Prolixin is fluphenazine hydrochloride, a phenothiazine drug with antipsychotic effects. It works in part by blocking dopamine D2 receptors in brain systems involved in psychosis, which can reduce hallucinations and delusions associated with schizophrenia.",
